You let your mind tap into your steam generators for energy, increasing your Mindpower in proportion to your steam level: [18, 23, 27, 30, 33 (TL1-5; WIL 100)] when at full steam and 0 when at 0 steam.

Using a psionic talent will feedback into your generators, increasing your Steam power by [15, 19, 23, 26, 28 (TL1-5; WIL 100)] for your next steamtech talent.

Using a steamtech talent will feedback into psionic focus, increasing your psi level by [8, 16, 21, 25, 29 (TL1-5)].

The effects increase with your Willpower.
